  <section class="container section">
    <div class="article-body">
      <p>The Crypto Realm is an independent media project built around one idea: freedom. That means the freedom to hold your own money and move it when you want, to whoever you want, with no middleman. It also means the freedom to know what powerful institutions are doing.</p>

      <h2>Crypto is the foundation</h2>
      <p>Bitcoin and other decentralized tools give people self-custody and the ability to send value anywhere, any time, 24/7, without asking a bank for permission. We want more people to understand how powerful that is, and why it matters in a world of central banks, the Federal Reserve and growing financial control.</p>

      <h2>Beyond crypto</h2>
      <p>Our videos, articles and merchandise won’t always be about crypto. We also cover whistleblowers, government surveillance, digital ID, big pharma, secret societies, the Epstein files, and the wider question of how much control institutions should have over ordinary people’s lives. Some of these topics are sensitive and controversial, and they will be a growing part of this platform.</p>

      <h2>Facts first</h2>
      <p>We focus on documented material: leaked documents, court records, official statements and the work of whistleblowers, such as Edward Snowden’s disclosures about mass surveillance and the documents published by WikiLeaks. When we’re giving an opinion, or discussing something that isn’t proven, we’ll say so. We’ll show you the sources and leave the conclusions to you.</p>
      <p>You don’t have to agree with us. We only ask that you look at the evidence and think for yourself. Nothing here is financial, medical or legal advice. Please read our <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a>.</p>

